    "name": "Flashcard Hero",
    "steam_appid": 3282290,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of boring vocabulary flashcards? Gamify your study routine with innovative flashcard combat and RPG-like gameplay elements in Flashcard Hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through twelve cities featuring increasingly difficult enemies (and increasingly advanced vocabulary lists!) in your foreign language of choice: French, German, Spanish, Italian, Russian, Ukrainian, Japanese, Chinese (Simplified), Korean, Arabic, or Turkish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your  playstyle with Hero Stats as you gain levels and experience, earn Steam achievements, and compete with other players on the community leaderboard!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need to brush up first with a more traditional flashcard experience? Review vocabulary in a self-paced non-combat environment before taking on your flashcard enemies. Too easy? Try Hardcore Mode for extra intensity (and extra experience!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-= Patch 1.1 =-</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed a word library issue causing game to freeze while playing World 1, Zone 3 on Japanese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>**UPDATE 1.2</strong>**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added native language user interfaces in French, Russian, Spanish, and Chinese!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now scalable to various screen resolutions.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of boring vocabulary flashcards? Gamify your study routine with innovative flashcard combat and RPG-like gameplay elements in Flashcard Hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through twelve cities featuring increasingly difficult enemies (and increasingly advanced vocabulary lists!) in your foreign language of choice: French, German, Spanish, Italian, Russian, Ukrainian, Japanese, Chinese (Simplified), Korean, Arabic, or Turkish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your  playstyle with Hero Stats as you gain levels and experience, earn Steam achievements, and compete with other players on the community leaderboard!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need to brush up first with a more traditional flashcard experience? Review vocabulary in a self-paced non-combat environment before taking on your flashcard enemies. Too easy? Try Hardcore Mode for extra intensity (and extra experience!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-= Patch 1.1 =-</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed a word library issue causing game to freeze while playing World 1, Zone 3 on Japanese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>**UPDATE 1.2</strong>**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added native language user interfaces in French, Russian, Spanish, and Chinese!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now scalable to various screen resolutions.</p>",
